docs {
  202 { status: playing, notes: 5, totalMs: 525 }

  Same notes as the boot chime (soundStartup), so auditioning here tells
  you exactly what the boat does at power-up. Pitches RISE 880 -> 1760
  Hz; the trailing [0, 100] is a silence gap so it ends cleanly.
